<title>INDIA: Yield on India 91-day t-bill unchanged at 7.02 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on India 91-day t-bill unchanged at 7.02 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it maintained the cut-off rate at the weekly 91-day treasury bill auction at 98.28 rupees.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 7.02 percent.  </p>
<p>--</p>
